Z||000000||TRiAD||11-10-2001||02:09 PM||||OK, I just bought this car Tuesday. <BR>Since then;<BR>-The shifter got increasingly worse and <B>now won't even go into ANY gear!!!</B>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><BR>-The radio died<BR>-The brakes started squeaking<BR>-The exhaust has developed a major leak. (got pulled over!)<P>-------<P>I've spoken with Rodney about the shifter (when it was giving me trouble, but was still driveable) and he said it sounds like it has a CRAP SHIFTER in it, and that Twin Lakes (who isn't apparently open today) should have a replacement for cheap, since no one wants these 4spds anyway. <P>Now I'm out WAY too much for the car, I have NO transportation, and it's going to take a LOT of money, and time, and trouble to get it back on the road. I REALLY wanted to go to the NIFE meeting Saturday, too!<P>I'm sure once I fix everything that it CAN be a wonderful car, but it's going to take WAY more work than advertised. <BR>---I DO plan on fixing EVERYTHING on this car.--- <P>Anyway, <BR><FONT COLOR="red"><B>does anyone have a 4sp shifter assembly for REALLY cheap, for a desperate member?</B></FONT> <BR>I'll have to deal with the rest once it's on the road again. <P>Sorry for the rant, and thanks. No, THANKS a MILLION! You guys are the best, I know I'll find some help here...<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/85-Sig-2.gif">               <BR><B><I><u><FONT COLOR="red">TRiAD Motorsports</FONT></u></B> \\\\ <B>triadtuning@hotmail.com</B> //// Michael ~ 85 GT 4sp</I><p>[This message has been edited by TRiAD (edited 11-10-2001).]||||reg||1
